An original, hand-authored neon demo level (web/demo/) is planned to ship with the game
(build phase P8) so it will be fully playable with ZERO original SkyRoads data. Until that
lands, playing requires running the exporter against SkyRoads files you own.

Open owner decisions (see MERGER-PLAN.md §8): repository public-vs-private posture, and
whether to distribute original-derived assets or remain extract-only. Until resolved, the
project defaults to extract-only and local play.
